  partName: Center Inner Cover
  description: The Right Outer Cover is a large, elongated component located at the
    middle-right-center of the engine, made from Outer cover material. It acts as
    the engine's external casing, providing a protective barrier against environmental
    factors and debris. An interesting aspect of this cover is its aerodynamic design,
    which helps to reduce drag and enhance the engine's overall efficiency.
